=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x22;Helvetica Neue&#x22;, PingFangSC, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;color: rgb(62, 71, 83);line-height: 1.8em;letter-spacing: 0.05em;\">格式，发给同事看，展示处处有问题？</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;margin: 3pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block;overflow: hidden;transform: rotate(0deg);width: 372.556px;height: 287.226px;text-indent: 0px;\"><span><img width=\"372.556\" height=\"287.226\" style=\"margin-left: 0px;margin-top: 0px;width: 372.556px;height: 287.226px;\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=e8065a53&#x26;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FKVER9adz906DwMWKI0e6h8sdPQbhTdcGwuG3K3VlUNvibxZzLybvDjKkVUYwbeOkZhVpghdpFtlZZ7j05Nf7VsDia2gsuTMOLgEqiaQmbWYZgE%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Dpng%26from%3Dappmsg\"></span></span></p><p style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x22;Helvetica Neue&#x22;, PingFangSC, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;color: rgb(62, 71, 83);line-height: 1.8em;margin: 14px 0px;letter-spacing: 0.05em;\"><span>最近和不少团队沟通，发现大家都有个极度相似的痛点：用 AI 生成一个产物，不用像古法时代一样一步一步手搓了；可一旦要把这个东西分享给同事，熟悉的麻烦感立刻回来了。</span></p><p style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x22;Helvetica Neue&#x22;, PingFangSC, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;color: rgb(62, 71, 83);line-height: 1.8em;margin: 14px 0px;letter-spacing: 0.05em;\"><span>以前一星期才能手搓出来的东西，现在 AI 几秒钟就塞给你了，但产出越快，协作反而越卡壳：</span></p><ul style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: -apple-system, &#x22;system-ui&#x22;, &#x22;Helvetica Neue&#x22;, PingFangSC, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-size: medium;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;margin: 10px 0px;padding-left: 24px;\" class=\"\"><li style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x22;Helvetica Neue&#x22;, PingFangSC, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;color: rgb(62, 71, 83);line-height: 1.8em;margin: 6px 0px;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>产品经理用 AI 拼出新功能 Demo，手里只有个本地 HTML。拿给研发讨论，改一个交互就要改代码、重新打包、再发一次；</span></p></li><li style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x22;Helvetica Neue&#x22;, PingFangSC, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;color: rgb(62, 71, 83);line-height: 1.8em;margin: 6px 0px;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>销售用 AI 整理完客户方案 PPT，再让产品、技术确认细节，结果一个群里发出了十几个版本，改到最后谁也说不清哪一版才是最新的。</span></p></li><li style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x22;Helvetica Neue&#x22;, PingFangSC, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;color: rgb(62, 71, 83);line-height: 1.8em;margin: 6px 0px;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>运营赶着上线活动，用 AI 搭建了一个页面，上线前晚才发现移动端按钮错位，连夜拉上一大群看着截图一头雾水的研发排查问题，沟通费时费力；</span></p></li></ul><p style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x22;Helvetica Neue&#x22;, PingFangSC, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;color: rgb(62, 71, 83);line-height: 1.8em;margin: 14px 0px;letter-spacing: 0.05em;\"><span>你会发现，当下的核心矛盾已经变了：不再是\"AI 能不能帮我把东西做出来\"，<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">而是\"东西做出来之后，怎么让团队顺畅地接过去、继续高效地做下去\"。</span></span></p><h2 style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x22;Helvetica Neue&#x22;, PingFangSC, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;font-size: 18px;font-weight: 700;margin: 28px 0px 14px;padding-left: 12px;border-left: 6px solid rgb(3, 124, 230);line-height: 1.3em;\"><span>一、产品 Demo 交接：告别本地文件难协作，把 Demo 变成协作现场</span></h2><h3 style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x22;Helvetica Neue&#x22;, PingFangSC, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;font-size: 17px;font-weight: 700;color: rgb(3, 124, 230);margin: 22px 0px 10px;\"><span>Before : 本地页面老是出bug，根本无法共享协作</span></h3><p style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x22;Helvetica Neue&#x22;, PingFangSC, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;color: rgb(62, 71, 83);line-height: 1.8em;margin: 14px 0px;letter-spacing: 0.05em;\"><span>产品策划好不容易vibe coding出了一个符合自己预期不错的新功能 Demo，在自己电脑上运行的也很流畅。想要发给研发看看，结果打包发过去之后，研发打开完全看不了，本地引用的图片路径失效、样式文件缺失，画面直接\"缺胳膊少腿\"，有些精心做好的特效根本显示不出来。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;margin: 3pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block;overflow: hidden;transform: rotate(0deg);width: 393.807px;height: 255.954px;text-indent: 0px;\"><span><img width=\"393.807\" height=\"255.954\" style=\"margin-left: 0px;margin-top: 0px;width: 394px;height: 256px;\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=12e3cae7&#x26;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FKVER9adz905n515YxaaHiaxbicPCoqIgA91jnC1ox0roCqtN8icmv9FAFGrT4R0jJLK6VbMbXM12HmUX5dCTuCoA7vkL7aDhwngrDEOjQMC3Dc%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Dpng%26from%3Dappmsg\"></span></span></p><p style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x22;Helvetica Neue&#x22;, PingFangSC, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;color: rgb(62, 71, 83);line-height: 1.8em;margin: 14px 0px;letter-spacing: 0.05em;\"><span>策划只能一边尴尬地解释\"在我电脑上是好的\"，一边继续改页面，把丢失的文件补发给研发。</span></p><p style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x22;Helvetica Neue&#x22;, PingFangSC, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;color: rgb(62, 71, 83);line-height: 1.8em;margin: 14px 0px;letter-spacing: 0.05em;\"><span>连展示都容易出问题，更别提协作编辑。只要想微调一个样式，产品就得本地修改、重新打包、再重新发一次文件，群里的本地压缩包越堆越多，也越来越麻烦。</span></p><h3 style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x22;Helvetica Neue&#x22;, PingFangSC, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;font-size: 17px;font-weight: 700;color: rgb(3, 124, 230);margin: 22px 0px 10px;\"><span>After：存进 workbuddy 资料库，demo 直接变成了一个\"在线可协作的活页面\"</span></h3><p style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x22;Helvetica Neue&#x22;, PingFangSC, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;color: rgb(62, 71, 83);line-height: 1.8em;margin: 14px 0px;letter-spacing: 0.05em;\"><span>研发打开链接就能直接试手感、看效果，在页面里跟产品用评论互动，确定细节；</span></p><p style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x22;Helvetica Neue&#x22;, PingFangSC, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;color: rgb(62, 71, 83);line-height: 1.8em;margin: 14px 0px;letter-spacing: 0.05em;\"><span>需要进行修改时，产品和研发可以在页面里直接划线圈选任意区域，各自召唤专属 Agent 现场微调：\"把这个弹窗改成抽屉式\"，让Agent把进一步修改的活也干了；</span></p><p style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x22;Helvetica Neue&#x22;, PingFangSC, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;color: rgb(62, 71, 83);line-height: 1.8em;margin: 14px 0px;letter-spacing: 0.05em;\"><span>告别本地文件重发和版本混乱，多人多 Agent 在同一画布上并行处理，大家眼前的永远是正在运行、最确定的同一个版本。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;margin-top:3pt;margin-bottom:3pt;margin-left:0pt;margin-right:0pt;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block;overflow: hidden;transform:rotate(0deg);width: 411.75832020997376px;height: 531.3011023622047px;text-indent: 0;\"><span><img width=\"411.758\" height=\"531.301\" style=\"margin-left:0px;margin-top:0px;width:100%;\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=dee1cb58&#x26;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FKVER9adz906DvGXZ4DrXDAlCYXVrniaT1e0P1u824tXP3vbcdJ0JwZv3ueJDn2fMJiau529Obube950jm5fBfO1D0LpSOly01pzTyWE3icMSN4%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Dpng%26from%3Dappmsg\"></span></span></p><h2 style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x22;Helvetica Neue&#x22;, PingFangSC, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;font-size: 18px;font-weight: 700;margin: 28px 0px 14px;padding-left: 12px;border-left: 6px solid rgb(3, 124, 230);line-height: 1.3em;\"><span>二、PPT AI 协同 ：告别本地 N 个版本，多人多 Agent 在线编辑</span></h2><h3 style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x22;Helvetica Neue&#x22;, PingFangSC, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;font-size: 17px;font-weight: 700;color: rgb(3, 124, 230);margin: 22px 0px 10px;\"><span>Before : PPT版本满天飞，手动修改效率低下</span></h3><p style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x22;Helvetica Neue&#x22;, PingFangSC, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;color: rgb(62, 71, 83);line-height: 1.8em;margin: 14px 0px;letter-spacing: 0.05em;\"><span>销售跟大客户初步沟通了解了基本情况，想用 AI 生成一版精致又丰富的客户方案 PPT，为了确保交付可行，他把PPT发给产品和技术团队共同确认细节。产品看到表达有些偏差的能力，技术看到有些问题的技术参数，售后看到一些不符合这个客户的习惯的细节，纷纷表示要修改PPT细节，帮助销售同学调整措辞和表达。</span></p><p style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x22;Helvetica Neue&#x22;, PingFangSC, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;color: rgb(62, 71, 83);line-height: 1.8em;margin: 14px 0px;letter-spacing: 0.05em;\"><span>产品发送了一份功能修改的意见，技术把第一版PPT下载下来改了一些细节又传回去，售后给到了客户公司的一些背景材料和意见补充。</span></p><p style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x22;Helvetica Neue&#x22;, PingFangSC, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;color: rgb(62, 71, 83);line-height: 1.8em;margin: 14px 0px;letter-spacing: 0.05em;\"><span>短短半天，群里就出现了令人头大的各种材料和文件，以及N个版本的客户方案PPT。销售顿时感到无奈，AI时代了，为什么PPT协作还是如此古朴又麻烦。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;margin: 3pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block;overflow: hidden;transform: rotate(0deg);width: 387px;height: 144.232px;text-indent: 0px;\"><span><img width=\"387\" height=\"144.232\" style=\"margin-left: 0px;margin-top: 0px;width: 100%;\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=3b4446b5&#x26;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FKVER9adz906BGsjBLCKWXtRvYfQGtoFDfDePupvHf0Z9d4QwvATwN3zJKLakoAY1pCIr3wY8FyoYA2Gia2aibiccQFvicDJiaibcYC9LDDQpOZJQg%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Dpng%26from%3Dappmsg\"></span></span></p><h3 style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x22;Helvetica Neue&#x22;, PingFangSC, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;font-size: 17px;font-weight: 700;color: rgb(3, 124, 230);margin: 22px 0px 10px;\"><span>After：把PPT存进资料库， 多人多Agent一起共创（内测中，即将上线）</span></h3><p style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x22;Helvetica Neue&#x22;, PingFangSC, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;color: rgb(62, 71, 83);line-height: 1.8em;margin: 14px 0px;letter-spacing: 0.05em;\"><span>产品发现某页功能描述有偏差，直接在页面上圈选评论，技术觉得参数需要调整，把对应图表标注出来，让AI帮忙编辑好；</span></p><p style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x22;Helvetica Neue&#x22;, PingFangSC, &#x22;Microso